# Swinging thorn vine, native 24x40 frames: hanging, swung left, swung right (flip of left).
# Anchored at the top centre; the pendulum is the renderer's rotation or the swing frames.
# The lit edge (#594, 2026-11-27): in `hang` and `swing-left` the left contour pixel of the stem and the knot is the dim olive
# `N` in every row, not ink (the thorns stay bone), so the vine keeps a clear margin over the active contrast floor on the
# near-black background. swing-right is the mirror, lit on the right; the game draws only `hang`.
size 24 40
color k 0b0814
color n 8a8a2a
color N 4a4a18
color b efe6c4
frame hang
